 "proof": [
  {
   "text": "By [lemma-nagata-invertible-ideal-is-effective-cartier], local bases of\nthe two ideals are regular elements $a$ and $b$. Their product is generated\nby $ab$, which is regular because multiplication by $a$ and by $b$ are\ninjective. These local generators give the required rank-one bases.",
